Paste any of the following and I’ll tailor the scaffold precisely:
1. Route list: `METHOD /path` (+ query params)
2. Example request/response JSON for each route (including error responses)
3. Auth scheme (JWT, HMAC, internal header, etc.)
4. Upstreams (DB, Redis, other HTTP services) and timeouts
5. Any special behavior (streaming, file uploads, long polling)

And tell me your deployment environment (Kubernetes? ECS? bare VM?) so I can adapt the cutover steps to your routing mechanism.
